Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:46:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(libScePad): trigger effect state from the game's effect
 and the trigger travel; pad output to Kyty (ABI 1.4)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
